# The example of the README. Its data objects have types of a class diagram; here their objects
# are given as plain data. The conditions of the process read their attributes.
set order = {"orderID": "O-1", "customerID": "C-7", "numberOfOrderedProducts": 2, "totalCost": 99.5}
set checker = {"allProductsAvailable": true}
set agreement = {"customerID": "C-7", "isOrderPickedUp": false}
start
expect open ProcessOrder
complete ProcessOrder
# one instance of the check per ordered product
complete CheckProductAvailability
expect open CheckProductAvailability
complete CheckProductAvailability
# all products are available
expect open PrepareAndPackProducts
complete PrepareAndPackProducts
# the customer does not pick the order up, so the sub-process ShipOrder runs
expect open ShipOrder.SecurePackageWithTape
complete SecurePackageWithTape
complete SelectShippingCarrier
complete PrintShippingLabel
complete AttachLabelToPacket
expect status COMPLETED
